+# SDL_GPU production pipeline audit with Freelancer vertex layouts
+
+Date: 2026-10-19
+
+## Scope
+
+The SDL_GPU pipeline audit now supplies typed, stride-checked vertex attributes
+for the production `Basic_FVF`, `PBR`, `Basic_Skinned`, and `PBR_Skinned` shader
+bundles. The first two use a representative interleaved Freelancer FVF layout
+(position, normal, diffuse color and four UV sets). The skinned bundles use a
+DFM-style layout with two UV sets, float bone weights, unsigned byte bone IDs,
+and two tangent components. The normal-mapped skinned vertex shader now declares
+`boneIds` as `uint4`, matching the unsigned integer GPU input. All other bundles
+continue to use their reflected synthetic audit layout.
+
+This checks SDL_GPU pipeline creation and release with those selected vertex
+formats. It does not draw production meshes, resolve real materials/textures,
+exercise the game render graph, or prove visual correctness or runtime
+performance. The layouts are representative declarations, not extraction from
+loaded retail mesh buffers. The Vulkan driver on this Intel Haswell test host
+reported incomplete support, so the result is a pipeline/API check on this host,
+not a general hardware compatibility claim.
+
+## Verification
+
+Release build (`net10.0`, .NET SDK/runtime rooted at `/opt/dotnet-10`):
+
+```text
+dotnet build src/lancer/lancer.csproj -c Release --no-restore -p:UseSharedCompilation=false
+Build succeeded. 0 errors, 168 warnings.
+```
+
+Focused vertex-layout tests:
+
+```text
+dotnet test src/LibreLancer.Tests/LibreLancer.Tests.csproj --no-restore -p:UseSharedCompilation=false --filter FullyQualifiedName~SDL3GpuVertexInputLayoutTests
+Passed: 3, Failed: 0, Skipped: 0.
+```
+
+Production pipeline audit on the available Vulkan/Intel Haswell SDL_GPU driver:
+
+```text
+SDL_GPU_DRIVER=vulkan dotnet src/lancer/bin/Release/net10.0/lancer.dll --sdl-gpu-production-pipeline-audit
+SDL_GPU production pipeline audit passed: 25 bundles, 3487 pipelines created and released.
+```
+
+Mesa printed `Haswell Vulkan support is incomplete`; despite that driver warning,
+this audit completed successfully. The audit creates and releases pipelines; it
+does not submit production mesh draws.
